caption: Spawn Trait Cap
tradition-component: spawn-trait-cap

For permanent mutations purchased through Spawn's discovery and retention rules, the final character-point value of each individual Spawn trait must be strictly less than twice the character's current Gift Value. Spawn replaces ordinary Super or Psi trait-value caps for these embodied mutations with this per-trait ceiling. Other campaign-wide hard limits still apply.

Purchased levels of an existing Spawn trait may be increased normally without another Power Stunt, provided the trait remains below the current Spawn Trait Cap. Increasing a trait does not deepen its position in the retention chain.
